xt\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Go</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Go straight ahead.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Turn</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Turn right.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hang</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hang a left at the lights.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Head</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Head up this street.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Make</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Make a quick right.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Describing Places in a Building", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can describe the location of things in a building using <span class=\"strong\">prepositions</span>: ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Preposition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inside/ in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in a place \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"an exact position\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"next to \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beside something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"located on the surface\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the direction of  a place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"across from\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"opposite something\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Go through the revolving doors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's inside the building.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Next to the stairs", "type": "example"}, {"content": "On the second floor", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's across from the elevators.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " In the basement", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tricky", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The directions are a little tricky.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when asking for directions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "quick ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sudden", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make a quick right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "you got it", "type": "name"}, {"content": "that's right; you are correct", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Anjali</span>: The bakery is this way? <span class=\"strong\">Beth</span>: You got it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "lights", "type": "name"}, {"content": "street signals (red, yellow and green lights to tell drivers to stop and go)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Take a right at the lights.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "revolving doors", "type": "name"}, {"content": "doors that turn at the entrance of a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Go through the revolving doors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a new place in your town.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue about how to get there from your home.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about a place in my town.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express location in a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for and give directions.", "type": "text"}]}]}